id: interface/new-yawn-coordinate-workbench-v0.1-corrections
title: "New Yawn workbench draft corrections"
kind: correction-record
status: proposed
updated: 2026-09-01
corrects: interface/new-yawn-coordinate-workbench-v0.1.yawn

corrections:
  - id: draft-resolution-semantics
    before: >
      The resolution level was described as the highest cumulative guarantee
      while the first implementation illuminated cells from attributed model
      proposals.
    after: >
      The visible number is `draft_orientation_resolution`: explicit proposed
      coverage over the ten-cell View. Every cell retains its epistemic and
      lifecycle state. A separate accepted/observed/verified maturity measure
      may be added only after evidence shows it is useful.
    reason: >
      Proposed coverage must not be cast as accepted semantic state, truth,
      intelligence, autonomy, maturity, authority, or proof.

  - id: proposal-disposition-boundary
    before: >
      A local Accept action could be read as accepting the target cell into the
      Orientation Map.
    after: >
      Accept locally and Reject locally disposition only the exact proposal.
      They do not alter Orientation Map state, intelligence binding, parentage,
      Plant state, authority, or proof.
    reason: "Recommendation acceptance is not a semantic write or effect grant."

  - id: one-question-default
    before: "The deterministic Auto-lacuna prototype returned up to three foreground proposals."
    after: >
      Auto-lacuna foregrounds exactly one question or hold by default. Any
      alternatives belong behind Inspect with their comparison receipt.
    reason: "Conforms to yawn.inquiry-selection.v0.1 and the one-question interface invariant."

merge_rule: >
  These corrections must be folded into the base draft before promotion or
  canonical indexing. Until then the correction record takes precedence for
  the paired product branch.

proof:
  expected:
    - "The UI says draft orientation resolution."
    - "Cell state remains proposed/unknown/verified after proposal disposition."
    - "Auto-lacuna returns one foreground proposal."
  status: branch-implemented-awaiting-verification
